$
\{n\in\mathbb{N}:\mathbb{P}(d(X_n,Y_{n_0})<r+\frac{\varepsilon}{2})>\delta_{*}(Y_{n_0})\}\notin\mathcal{I}$. Therefore, we can write
$$
A(\varepsilon)=\{n\in\mathbb{N}:\mathbb{P}(d(X_n,Y_{n_0})<r+\frac{\varepsilon}{2})>\ell\}\notin\mathcal{I}.
$$
