	Suppose that the initial data satisfies $a \in H^1(\Omega)$ and $a_z: = \partial_z a \in L^3(\Omega)$, as well as the compatibility conditions: $\operatorname{div}_H \bar a = 0$, the horizontal periodicity, and $a = 0$ on $\Gamma_b$ in case of (\ref{eq: Dirichlet BC}).
